{"id":"beats-d5bf25","type":"CREATE","payload":{"kind":"BUG","title":"Task list for children in Epics doest have type or state icons and colors","description":"When running `beats show \u003cepic-id\u003e` command, the task list for children in Epics does not display type or state icons and colors. This makes it difficult to quickly identify the type and status of each child task. Formatting should follow our standard conventions for displaying task types and states, including appropriate icons and color coding. See `beats ls`"},"created_at":"2025-12-19T15:38:00.816141Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
